{"strings": [
  {"text":"FILE No. 0417","translation":"ファイル No. 0417","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/desk.js"},
  {"text":"UNDER OBSERVATION","translation":"経過観察中","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/desk.js"},
  {"text":"CASE FILES","translation":"個人ファイル","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/deskfront.js"},
  {"text":"Dr I. V. Strogova","translation":"I・V・ストロゴワ医師","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/nameplate.js"},
  {"text":"psychotherapist","translation":"心理療法士","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/nameplate.js"},
  {"text":"ONE AT A TIME","translation":"おひとり一枚","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/tissues.js"},
  {"text":"it's just a mirror","translation":"ただの鏡です","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"EXIT","translation":"出口","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"only after the session","translation":"セッション終了後のみ","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"YOUR FEELINGS MATTER*","translation":"あなたの気持ちは大切です*","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"*and will be noted","translation":"*記録されます","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"Dr Strogova's Office","translation":"ストロゴワ医師の診察室","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"Make yourself comfortable. As far as that's possible.","translation":"どうぞおくつろぎください。できる範囲で。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"Sit down. The armchair is exactly where it should be.","translation":"おかけください。椅子は、あるべき場所にきっちり置いてあります。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"Your file is already open. It's thicker than you thought.","translation":"あなたのファイルはもう開かれています。思っていたより分厚い。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[1] text"},
  {"text":"Tissues: one at a time. That is part of the therapy too.","translation":"ティッシュはおひとり一枚。これも治療の一部です。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[2] text"},
  {"text":"The clock on the wall says ten to three: the session's time is up.","translation":"壁の時計は三時十分前。セッションの時間は終わりです。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/script.js"},
  {"text":"The page in the file is full: the doctor has written it from top to bottom.","translation":"ファイルのページが尽きた。医師はそれを上から下まで書き埋めた。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/script.js"}
]}
